Here is the C++ implementation. It uses the standard **Boost C++ Libraries** (Regex, Date Time, Program Options, Filesystem) to replicate the Python logic (Multithreading, NLP, Data Cleaning, Database interaction, and Charting).

**Note:** This code requires the `Boost` library installed on your system (`libboost-regex-dev`, `libboost-date-time-dev`, `libboost-program-options-dev`, `libboost-filesystem-dev`).

